 "remarks": "Beautifully updated and meticulously maintained, this sun-filled unit offers a perfect combination of comfort, style, and convenience. Featuring crown molding and bamboo flooring throughout, the spacious living room flows seamlessly into the dining area and kitchen, complete with granite countertops and stainless-steel appliances. The generously sized primary bedroom features a walk-in closet and sliding glass doors leading to a deck with beautiful views. An updated bathroom, new windows, doors, sliders, electric wall heaters, and hot water heater add to the home's appeal.  Additional highlights include private storage, dedicated laundry, and two assigned parking spaces, one in front and one in the rear. Ideally situated in the desirable Springdale neighborhood along the New Canaan border, this property offers easy access to the Merritt Parkway and is within walking distance of the Springdale train station. Low common charges make this move-in-ready home an exceptional opportunity!",
